    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "In this petition, the grievance of the petitioner is that acquisition proceeding under Land Acquisition Act, 1894, lapsed, necessary and prompt steps have not been taken by the respondent authorities for acquiring the subject land and payment of appropriate compensation, in terms of provisions of The Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 570,
      "end": 980,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Land Acquisition Act, 1894",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 658,
          "end": 684
        },
        {
          "text": "Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 873,
          "end": 979
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "2. Reply affidavits on record indicate that certain steps were taken by the respondents for ascertaining the compensation payable.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 982,
      "end": 1112,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "But, it appears that such steps have not fructified into actual payment of compensation to the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1113,
      "end": 1219,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "It is not clear that as to whether the efforts of the respondents have either culminated in an award by way of private negotiation, or steps for compulsory acquisition have been taken.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1220,
      "end": 1404,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
